message: "Cite this SG-DLS software release and report the release commit and experiment source separately."
title: "BMPOA-FF-SG-DLS: feasibility-first dynamic-discrete steel-truss sizing"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bahrambeigi"
    given-names: "Yousef"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
repository-code: "https://github.com/y0bahrambeigi/bhb"
url: "https://github.com/y0bahrambeigi/bhb/releases/tag/sgdls-v0.1.0"
license: "MIT"
abstract: "Controlled research release comparing feasibility-first BMPOA core, RandomDiscreteLS and sensitivity-guided discrete local search on two steel-truss benchmarks with five paired seeds and 35,070 evaluator calls per run. The study does not establish statistical superiority of SG-DLS."
keywords:
  - structural optimization
  - discrete truss sizing
  - analytical sensitivity
  - feasibility-first optimization
  - reproducible research
